    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/60fb6b6087626f23775abcd5c1382eed.avif?t=1754900841\" width=616 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand of Hexes is a <strong>no-text deckbuilder</strong> and <strong>tower defense</strong> game where you control the enemies' paths by constructing deadly mazes \u2013 using towers with crazy attack patterns. Create a perfect deck of exotic towers and magical spells that boost your defenses or slay your enemies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/03e70934520a2c4928df752290a16026.avif?t=1754900841\" width=616 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/6d0e6d2ae16282ccbe4eb8f4f59b3bbf.poster.avif?t=1754900841\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/6d0e6d2ae16282ccbe4eb8f4f59b3bbf.webm?t=1754900841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/6d0e6d2ae16282ccbe4eb8f4f59b3bbf.mp4?t=1754900841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is <strong>unique</strong> with different decks, encounters, and levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is <strong>no text and no descriptions - </strong>find out what each tower and spell does through trial and error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way across a variety of <strong>procedural maps</strong> - and do it again, but <strong>harder</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/cb47239c2c410c259e7ee5764c656dfb.avif?t=1754900841\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/e3d7145838fb110cd0d6b63e8f1298cf.poster.avif?t=1754900841\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/e3d7145838fb110cd0d6b63e8f1298cf.webm?t=1754900841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/e3d7145838fb110cd0d6b63e8f1298cf.mp4?t=1754900841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hand of Hexes towers have <strong>unique attack patterns</strong>: they might only shoot in one direction, circle projectiles or launch <strong>fierce bees</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position your towers to guide the enemies through deadly mazes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff your towers via <strong>spell cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/d44d9473bea1f86d0cd8fb598647c31b.avif?t=1754900841\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/60fb6b6087626f23775abcd5c1382eed.avif?t=1754900841\" width=616 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand of Hexes is a <strong>no-text deckbuilder</strong> and <strong>tower defense</strong> game where you control the enemies' paths by constructing deadly mazes \u2013 using towers with crazy attack patterns. Create a perfect deck of exotic towers and magical spells that boost your defenses or slay your enemies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/03e70934520a2c4928df752290a16026.avif?t=1754900841\" width=616 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/6d0e6d2ae16282ccbe4eb8f4f59b3bbf.poster.avif?t=1754900841\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/6d0e6d2ae16282ccbe4eb8f4f59b3bbf.webm?t=1754900841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/6d0e6d2ae16282ccbe4eb8f4f59b3bbf.mp4?t=1754900841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is <strong>unique</strong> with different decks, encounters, and levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is <strong>no text and no descriptions - </strong>find out what each tower and spell does through trial and error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way across a variety of <strong>procedural maps</strong> - and do it again, but <strong>harder</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/cb47239c2c410c259e7ee5764c656dfb.avif?t=1754900841\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/e3d7145838fb110cd0d6b63e8f1298cf.poster.avif?t=1754900841\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/e3d7145838fb110cd0d6b63e8f1298cf.webm?t=1754900841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/e3d7145838fb110cd0d6b63e8f1298cf.mp4?t=1754900841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hand of Hexes towers have <strong>unique attack patterns</strong>: they might only shoot in one direction, circle projectiles or launch <strong>fierce bees</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position your towers to guide the enemies through deadly mazes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff your towers via <strong>spell cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/d44d9473bea1f86d0cd8fb598647c31b.avif?t=1754900841\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p></li></ul>",
